Third-party dependencies are fetched at build time and keep their own
licenses, none of which is copyleft: SDL3 and SoLoud (zlib), QuickJS-NG
(MIT), glslang (BSD-3-Clause and MIT), SDL_shadercross (zlib), SPIRV-Cross
(Apache-2.0), stb (MIT / public domain), pl_mpeg (MIT) and, when enabled,
Effekseer (MIT). Apache-2.0 is why this project is GPLv3 rather than
GPLv2: the two are incompatible, and SPIRV-Cross is linked in whenever
RMMZ_RUNTIME_SHADERS is enabled.
